{
    "name": "[Baseline] - WIN - D - Cloud PC Session Security",
    "description": "Secures the session on a Windows 365 Cloud PC or Azure Virtual Desktop session host: nothing copied from the virtual desktop to the local device, no COM, LPT or USB devices redirected, the session disconnected on lock, screen capture from the local device blocked and a watermark with the connection ID across the desktop. Baseline assignment: none by default — belongs on SEC-Cloud-PC. Source: OpenIntuneBaseline Windows 365 v1.0 — Device Security - D - Connectivity Settings and Resource Redirection, without the four settings that [Baseline] - WIN - D - Remote Desktop and RPC already sets; IntuneAdmin — Baseline - AVD - Enable screen capture protection and Enable watermarking.",
